6651706682600","game_id":"steam-4823440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.2.3 – Animal Feeding, Cleaning & Hotbar System!","summary":"Demo Update v0.2.3 – Animal Feeding, Cleaning & Hotbar System! 🐾 Hello, Pet Shop Owners! 🐱🐠 A brand-new update for Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator is now live! This update introduces animal feeding and cleaning mechanics, a new hotbar system, improved product labels, and several gameplay improvements! 🐟 NEW: Animal Feeding & Cleaning System! Taking care of your animals is now part of running your pet shop!Animal Feeding: Feed your fish and birds to keep them happy and healthy.Cleaning System: Keep a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:50:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682600","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:27:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4823440-1846018067933877","game_id":"steam-4823440","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.2.2 – Build Mode, New Products & Improvements!","summary":"Demo Update v0.2.2 – Build Mode, New Products & Improvements! 🐾 Hello, Pet Shop Owners! 🐱🐠 A new update for Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator is now live! This update introduces a brand-new Build Mode, new products, improvements to the end-of-day system, and several bug fixes. 🛠️ NEW: Build Mode!Floor Customization: Change your shop's flooring with different materials and textures.Wall Painting: Give your shop a fresh look with a variety of wall paint colors.Make your pet shop feel more personal and c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T16:12:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:27:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4823440-1845383656386379","game_id":"steam-4823440","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.2.1 is Live!","summary":"Update v0.2.1 is Live! A new update for Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator is now available! This update focuses on improving the checkout experience, shop management, customer behavior, progression, and overall quality of life. Shop & Stand Improvements:- The control for taking animals and products back from stands has been changed to Right Mouse Button (RMB).- Pet Stands and Product Stands can now be moved with M even when they contain items or animals. Their contents and price settings are preserved","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T13:39:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386379","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:27:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4823440-1845383656377503","game_id":"steam-4823440","kind":"announcement","title":"Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator Demo is OUT NOW! 🎉 The wait is over. The Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator Demo is now available to play on Steam! Build and manage your own pet shop, fill your store with adorable animals, stock the shelves, serve your customers, work the checkout, and experience the first days of running your very own pet business. This demo is just the beginning, and your feedback will be incredibly valuable as I continue developing and improving the game. If you enjoy the demo, please c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:57:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377503","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:27:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4823440-1844115010489024","game_id":"steam-4823440","kind":"announcement","title":"Ultimate Pet Shop Simulator Demo Launches on September 30!","